# Composer environment template.
#
# Runtime parses .env.json (JSON form of the same two keys) via
# fs.readFileSync — see docs/adr/0001-contracts.md (C0.1 / Wave-1 F1.1).
#
# To run locally:
#   1. cp .env.example .env.json   (then re-write as valid JSON)
#   2. Or set the variables in your shell and skip the file entirely.
#
# .env / .env.json are gitignored. Do NOT commit real credentials.

ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=
ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.z.ai/api/anthropic
